WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.175
One sheet of

00:00:00.987 --> 00:00:02.602
paper eight pages

00:00:02.697 --> 00:00:03.887
zero staples

00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:05.601
Fold an A4

00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:06.344
sheet in half

00:00:06.155 --> 00:00:07.039
three times

00:00:07.158 --> 00:00:08.030
cut the center

00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:08.455
crease

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:09.492
fold it into

00:00:09.304 --> 00:00:10.306
a cross and

00:00:10.118 --> 00:00:10.730
you get an

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:11.662
eight-page booklet

00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:12.511
with no glue

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.315
fanzines dot app

00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:14.834
lets you lay

00:00:14.646 --> 00:00:15.612
out each page

00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:16.343
right-side up

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:17.711
then places all

00:00:17.535 --> 00:00:18.395
eight panels on

00:00:18.207 --> 00:00:18.843
the sheet

00:00:19.032 --> 00:00:20.211
top row rotated

00:00:20.271 --> 00:00:21.532
as a 300

00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:22.735
DPI PDF

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.343
Everything stays in

00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:24.909
your browser

00:00:25.048 --> 00:00:25.837
And a safe

00:00:25.649 --> 00:00:26.734
margin scales the

00:00:26.545 --> 00:00:27.465
layout to about

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.526
95 percent

00:00:28.715 --> 00:00:29.835
so home printers

00:00:29.647 --> 00:00:30.389
don't clip the

00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:30.955
covers

00:00:31.494 --> 00:00:32.508
Full story on

00:00:32.319 --> 00:00:33.215
the dashboard
